      "id": "mission",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">MISSION · 1 MIN</span><h2>Today's mission</h2><p>Describe three things that happened at work last week. Speak for <b>120 seconds</b>, using at least <b>3 of today’s 5 chunks</b>. Say it first; write only brief notes.</p><p class=\"instruction\">5 chunk mỗi ngày · tối đa 5 chunk mới. Ngày tổng kết ôn lại chunk đã học.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "weekly-baseline",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">BEFORE PRACTICE · 1 MIN</span><p class=\"instruction\">Làm bài nói đầu tuần trước khi đọc bài và xem ví dụ. Ghi lại những gì bạn tự nói được.</p><div class=\"weekly-check\"><h3>Weekly baseline</h3><p>Repeat this same 60-second task at the beginning and end of the week: <b>Describe recent work, a lesson learned, and your next plan.</b></p><p class=\"instruction\">Làm riêng với bài nói chính nếu thời lượng khác. Tự đếm số lần dừng lâu hơn 3 giây; không suy ra độ chính xác từ thời lượng.</p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\">Actual baseline speaking seconds:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-seconds\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\">Pauses longer than 3 seconds:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-pauses\" min=\"0\" max=\"600\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\">Target chunks used (0–5):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-used\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\">Chunks recalled without help (0–5):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\">A recurring error to work on:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\"><p id=\"weekly-comparison\" role=\"status\"></p></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "warmup",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Warm-up recall</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Recall before opening today’s chunk cards. Ôn theo mốc bài học +1, +3, +7, +14; mỗi lần chọn vài chunk để giữ bài gọn.</p><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 21 · ôn sau 1 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Support your point with a concrete example. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"For example, our daily meeting now takes fifteen minutes.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 19 · ôn sau 3 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Report a decision your team made. <small>Use it in a different project or situation.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We decided to launch a smaller version.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 15 · ôn sau 7 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Explain what matters to you personally. <small>Say two connected sentences aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"For me, a quiet place is important for difficult tasks.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><p class=\"recall-source\">Day 8 · ôn sau 14 bài</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Describe the condition that triggers a problem. <small>Answer as if a colleague has just asked you.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"It doesn't work when customers use a phone.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-warm-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "reading",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">INPUT · 4 MIN</span><h2>Read, listen to your own voice, and notice</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read once for meaning. Then read aloud; on the second pass, notice how the speaker uses whole phrases.</p><div class=\"reading\">Last week, I talked to several customers about our app. I completed a short survey and shared the results with my team. We found that users wanted a simpler menu. On Friday, we met to discuss a new design. The result was a clear plan for the first change. I think the survey helped because we heard the same problem from different people. For example, some users could not find the help page. We decided to move it closer to the main screen. This week, I'm focusing on testing that change with two customers before we release it.</div>"
    },
