    {
      "id": "variation",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">VARIATION · 4 MIN</span><h2>Change it, then make it yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Say each answer first, then type a short sentence. Two quick variations per chunk; keep the same pattern.</p><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>1. Last week, I…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\">A. Use this idea: finish a customer survey.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-1-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>2. I completed…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\">A. Use this idea: the customer survey.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-2-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>3. We found that…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\">A. Use this idea: customers needed clearer instructions.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-3-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>4. On Friday…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\">A. Use this idea: share the survey results.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-4-b\"></div><div class=\"variation-item\"><h3>5. The result was…</h3><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\">A. Use this idea: a simpler design.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-a\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\">B. Make a different sentence about your own work.</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-var-5-b\"></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "rapid-recall",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">RAPID RECALL · 3 MIN</span><h2>Recall in about three seconds</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Look away from the chunk cards. Try to start speaking within 3 seconds, then type what you said. A model appears only after an attempt; other natural answers are possible.</p><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Start a short account of last week's work. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"Last week, I talked to five customers.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-1-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Report a finished task. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I completed the first version of the new menu.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-2-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Report something your team discovered. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"We found that users wanted a simpler menu.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-3-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Say what happened on a specific day. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"On Friday, our team agreed to change the design.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-4-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"today\"><p>Describe the outcome of past work. <small>Say one sentence aloud.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"The result was that users could find the menu faster.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-5-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div><div class=\"recall-item\" data-recall-kind=\"old\"><p>Say which part of an opinion you agree with. <small>Say one sentence from memory.</small></p><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\">Your spoken answer (type it after speaking):</label><input class=\"text recall-answer\" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"recall-check\" data-model=\"I agree that the deadline is important.\" aria-controls=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\">Đã thử · xem một cách nói</button><p class=\"feedback recall-feedback\" id=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-feedback\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><label class=\"choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-rapid-6-unaided\" class=\"recall-unaided\"> Tôi đã tự nhớ trước khi xem gợi ý</label></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "speaking",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">SPEAK · 5 MIN</span><h2>Make the language yours</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Read aloud three times. Follow the pauses marked by / and emphasize the important words.</p><div class=\"shadow\">Last week, I tested the app. /<br>I completed the report. /<br>We found that the page was slow.</div><p><b>Speaking challenge:</b> Describe three things that happened at work last week.</p><p class=\"instruction\">Speak for 120 seconds. Use at least 3 chunks. Notes only: your situation · two details · a reason or problem · your next step. Do not write a full script first.</p><textarea id=\"speaking-response\" data-save=\"speaking\" placeholder=\"Nói thành tiếng trước, rồi nhập lại ít nhất 8 từ bạn đã nói…\"></textarea><div class=\"row\"><button id=\"speaking-done\">Tôi đã nói thành tiếng</button><span id=\"status-speaking\">Chưa hoàn thành</span></div><div id=\"speak-feedback\" class=\"feedback\"></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "conversation",
      "className": "panel",
      "type": "rich",
      "html": "<span class=\"number\">CONVERSATION · 3 MIN</span><h2>A real work conversation</h2><p class=\"instruction\">Practise with a partner, or take both roles aloud. Your partner is a coworker. Open one question, answer it, then continue. Khi luyện cùng Codex, yêu cầu đóng vai đồng nghiệp và hỏi từng câu; trang này không có AI trò chuyện trực tiếp.</p><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 1</summary><p>What did you finish recently?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 2</summary><p>What happened during the work?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 3</summary><p>What did you learn?</p></details><details class=\"conversation-turn\"><summary>Colleague · question 4</summary><p>What are you planning next?</p></details><p class=\"instruction\">After 4 exchanges, choose at most 3 useful corrections. Say the improved sentences once more.</p>"
    },
